msgstr "der mitgelieferte SLOOP-3-Editor fehlt"

#: fm1companion/sloop3bk.py:41
msgid "Project saved on the FM-1"
msgstr "Auf dem FM-1 gespeichertes Projekt"

#: fm1companion/sloop3bk.py:41
msgid "Your sounds (with favourites and theme)"
msgstr "Deine Sounds (mit Favoriten und Theme)"

#: fm1companion/sloop3bk.py:42
msgid "Project as it was at that moment (unsaved changes too)"
msgstr "Projekt, wie es in dem Moment war (auch ungespeicherte Änderungen)"

#: fm1companion/sloop3bk.py:42
